.* SUPPORT: the task menu for user support.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='SUPPORT'.
:KEYL NAME=MENUKEYS HELP='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAJOR'.F16=Major menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=SUPPORT HELP=HLPSUPPORT KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.User Support and Education
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='HELP HLPUSEHELP' HELP='SUPPORT/OPT1'.How to use help
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD STRSCHIDX' HELP='SUPPORT/OPT2'.Search system help index
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='MENU MAJOR' HELP='SUPPORT/OPT3'.How to use commands
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD ASKQST' HELP='SUPPORT/OPT4'.Question and answer
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='MENU INFO' HELP='SUPPORT/OPT5'.QS/400 publications
:MENUI OPTION=7 ACTION='MENU USERHELP' HELP='SUPPORT/OPT7'.How to handle system problems
:MENUI OPTION=8 ACTION='MENU PROBLEM' HELP='SUPPORT/OPT8'.Problem handling
:MENUI OPTION=9 ACTION='CMD STREDU' HELP='SUPPORT/OPT9'.Online education
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPSUPPORT.User Support and Education - Help
:P.Where to learn the system: the help, the command menus and what to do
when something fails.
:P.Type an option number or a command and press Enter. F4 prompts the
command, F9 brings the previous one back, F12 returns to the menu shown
before this one.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPUSEHELP.How to Use Help
:P.Press F1 or the Help key anywhere for help about the place the cursor is
on: a field, an option, a function key or the message on the bottom
line. With the cursor elsewhere, the help is about the whole display.
:P.In a help window, F2 shows the help for the whole display, Page Down and
Page Up move through a long text, F12 closes the window and F3 leaves
help altogether.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the
option typed.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again
for the one before.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F16=Major menu
:PD.Shows menu MAJOR.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='SUPPORT/OPT1'.How to use help
:P.Option 1. Shows help&colon. How to use help.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='SUPPORT/OPT2'.Search system help index
:P.Option 2. Runs the STRSCHIDX command&colon. Search system help index.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='SUPPORT/OPT3'.How to use commands
:P.Option 3. Shows menu MAJOR&colon. How to use commands.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='SUPPORT/OPT4'.Question and answer
:P.Option 4. Runs the ASKQST command&colon. Question and answer.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='SUPPORT/OPT5'.QS/400 publications
:P.Option 5. Shows menu INFO&colon. QS/400 publications.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='SUPPORT/OPT7'.How to handle system problems
:P.Option 7. Shows menu USERHELP&colon. How to handle system problems.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='SUPPORT/OPT8'.Problem handling
:P.Option 8. Shows menu PROBLEM&colon. Problem handling.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='SUPPORT/OPT9'.Online education
:P.Option 9. Runs the STREDU command&colon. Online education.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
